# Grafana Dashboard Configuration for RAG System Performance

## Dashboard Overview
This dashboard provides comprehensive monitoring of the RAG Telegram Assistant's retrieval performance, including Phase 1 metrics for Recall@K, MRR, NDCG, and query expansion effectiveness.

